  "job_B9.2.2_20251003_114947": {
    "chunk_text": "we secgan ymb \u00fea ygland \u00fee on \u00feam Wendels\u00e6 sindon. Cipros \u00fe\u00e6t igland hit li\u00f0 ongean Cilicia & Issaurio on \u00feam s\u00e6s earme \u00fee man h\u00e6t Mesicos, & hit Creto \u00fe\u00e6t igland, him is be eastan se s\u00e6 \u00fee man Arfatium h\u00e6t, & westan & be nor\u00f0an Creticum se \u00d0ara iglanda \u00fee man h\u00e6t Ciclades \u00feara sindon \u00fereo & fiftig, & be eastan him is se Icarisca s\u00e6, & Sicilia \u00fe\u00e6t igland is \u00f0ryscyte. On \u00e6lces sceatan ende sindon beorgas. \u00deone nor\u00f0sceatan man h\u00e6t Polores; \u00fe\u00e6r is seo burh neah Mesana. & se su\u00f0sceata hatte Bachinum; \u00fe\u00e6r neah is sio burh Siracussana. & \u00feone westsceatan man h\u00e6t Libeum; \u00fe\u00e6r is seo burh neah \u00fee man h\u00e6t Libeum. & hit is an hund & syfan & fiftig mila lang, su\u00f0 & nor\u00f0; & se \u00feridda sceata is an hund & syfan & & be eastan \u00fe\u00e6m lande is se Wendels\u00e6, \u00fee man h\u00e6t Adriaticum, & be su\u00fean \u00fee man h\u00e6t Affricum, Sardina & Corsica \u00fea igland tod\u00e6le\u00f0 an lytel s\u00e6s earm, se is twa & twentig mila brad. Sardina is \u00fereo & \u00feritti mila lang, & twa & twentig mila brad. Him is be eastan se Wendels\u00e6 \u00fee man h\u00e6t Tirrenum, \u00fee Tiber sio ea ut scyt on; & be su\u00f0an se s\u00e6 Corsica him is Romeburh be eastan, & Sardine be su\u00f0an, & be westan \u00fea igland Balearis, & be Balearis \u00fea tu igland him is be nor\u00f0an Affrica, & Gades be westan, & Ispania be su",
